<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot a student bus and a school bus in Sinaloa, targeting civilians, while federal forces seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. In Florida, a Sinaloa Cartel cocaine pipeline into the Tampa Bay area was busted, leading to multiple arrests and a press conference announcing the dismantling of the drug ring. In Oklahoma City, an 18-year-old was arrested after a shooting that killed a 25-year-old veteran outside a bank, and another 18-year-old was arrested on murder and robbery complaints related to a bank shooting. Mexican bishops have urged authorities to search for a missing priest in Sinaloa. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WJTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQVDJfNU9JUlhmT19URHlNMk1RcHNzRVBFN19IbVpHVV81X29HSldoMHlZSW5uOFVKZTBUT1RrOUVaTnhJUjNhdEo4blp3OXVRdzZTZlZHM1YzVUMxeEtQcURSdWNOempLbUNXRFhWOWR6M0UyMzlUZWpXQTNfQjFUbDIwWUVYa1I1dkU3Qm9oWTNuU0pP?oc=5&quot;&gt;KOCO&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQaks5Um04c25NSE1CV2NmZ0JCVWxsVF9QQ1YxU3JxLWNZMDMxclYyQ3Bhb0pzdkw2X2lhaVNTYldHT2NheGplNlJpRDhSWXlFd1VscFJMVEdZTDNIQklocWdZcTVoX0NVMmdGWmFQNlU0VG0tRENsdy14LUlNV1lFaHg5M1VDdEdyTEFhZExiRU1nbnNWSW01R3BSNjNGUHZHelU2MzViTEVhejFkMHZobGswdmZMdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;KOKH&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOcmJWeDNZY29aMlI5ZnAyY28yUlRGU2l4SWZCOGFLTUJhX3hKSWlGM3dvaEJwWERMcWUweDFFVUUzXzYxVFczOXBpenR6bS0tQktyeXlsSGJpXzBRRVVPRGZ5VTBWcnhMLWtNQ0p6X0xyNzNOdnl1UFNGWGdsUHFKaUdpUXVQbFJMSk1NZHlJNUlUakJiLUMyRnY4RTI3Vlg1ZmZfTUQySk95MG1jLVVPMTF0SVNwQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WPLG Local 10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNQnhyQXNmR0FPUzRwQVo0cGZ2NzNPM